    {
      "index": 5,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 11:59:32",
      "taskId": "92e61f51-b365-4b7c-9999-90e85702742e",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "（抬头看了一眼手表，语气平淡略带疏离）“你好，请进。我只有15分钟，后面还有个生产会。之前也有几家做过类似方案的来聊过，说实话，效果都不理想。你简单说说，杰克有什么不一样的？”",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:12:36",
      "taskId": null,
      "taskState": null,
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "王总您好，我理解您时间紧。杰克不先谈概念，先看能不能稳定解决问题。您刚才说之前的方案效果不理想，主要是数据不准、操作复杂，还是现场执行跟不上？",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:12:39",
      "taskId": "e326f2ca-ff89-44f9-b6a9-f99ce05f7556",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": null,
      "actions": [
        {
          "identifier": "biz-common-side-roleplaying",
          "type": "progress",
          "actionName": null,
          "scoName": null,
          "scoType": null,
          "mode": null,
          "order": null,
          "reason": null,
          "nestedType": null,
          "progress": 10,
          "dialogRound": 1,
          "remainDuration": 113,
          "maxDialogRound": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:12:43",
      "taskId": "e326f2ca-ff89-44f9-b6a9-f99ce05f7556",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "（手指停止敲击桌面，身体微微前倾）你倒是直接。之前那家，数据源头就不准，一线工人嫌麻烦不愿用，最后成了摆设。你说能稳定解决问题，具体怎么保证数据准、工人愿意用？",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:13:33",
      "taskId": null,
      "taskState": null,
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "明白了。关键是数据从设备端自动采集，现场只用看异常和结果，不增加工人录入负担。您现在最痛的量化问题，是停机返工工时，还是面料浪费？",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:13:36",
      "taskId": "92dc2d16-cec7-49d2-b04b-f1de4b8c1c0e",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": null,
      "actions": [
        {
          "identifier": "biz-common-side-roleplaying",
          "type": "progress",
          "actionName": null,
          "scoName": null,
          "scoType": null,
          "mode": null,
          "order": null,
          "reason": null,
          "nestedType": null,
          "progress": 25,
          "dialogRound": 2,
          "remainDuration": 56,
          "maxDialogRound": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:13:40",
      "taskId": "92dc2d16-cec7-49d2-b04b-f1de4b8c1c0e",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "（靠回椅背，语气稍缓）现在是衬衫和T恤旺季，人手紧，加班成本高。返工和面料浪费都有，但最头疼的是——你能给我什么具体数据？比如省多少人、省多少料？别跟我讲概念。",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:13:58",
      "taskId": null,
      "taskState": null,
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "按您现有产线估算，如果返工和面料浪费各压降10%到15%，一年大概能省多少？我们先用一条线验证，不达标不扩展。",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:14:01",
      "taskId": "29e0aaa8-8a23-44b4-b4d9-52e5a934ac7e",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": null,
      "actions": [
        {
          "identifier": "biz-common-side-roleplaying",
          "type": "progress",
          "actionName": null,
          "scoName": null,
          "scoType": null,
          "mode": null,
          "order": null,
          "reason": null,
          "nestedType": null,
          "progress": 40,
          "dialogRound": 3,
          "remainDuration": 31,
          "maxDialogRound": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:14:05",
      "taskId": "29e0aaa8-8a23-44b4-b4d9-52e5a934ac7e",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "（眉头微皱，语气略带不满）我问的是你们的行业基准数据，不是让我自己算。你们服务过优衣库供应链，衬衫和T恤品类，实际落地后省了多少人力、面料节省率是多少？给我具体数字。",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "role": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:14:26",
      "taskId": null,
      "taskState": null,
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "杰克的底气来自设备端稳定性和数据闭环，江苏伍佳也是先做单线再复制。我建议本周五用30分钟看一条线，并做一版投入产出测算。您下午三点方便吗？",
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:14:28",
      "taskId": "7dfd2c48-77c9-44fd-8f95-38d2f0a0837a",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": null,
      "actions": [
        {
          "identifier": "biz-common-side-roleplaying",
          "type": "progress",
          "actionName": null,
          "scoName": null,
          "scoType": null,
          "mode": null,
          "order": null,
          "reason": null,
          "nestedType": null,
          "progress": 60,
          "dialogRound": 4,
          "remainDuration": 4,
          "maxDialogRound": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "role": "assistant",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-29 12:14:32",
      "taskId": "7dfd2c48-77c9-44fd-8f95-38d2f0a0837a",
      "taskState": "completed",
      "contentKind": "array",
      "text": "（手指轻敲桌面，语气仍带审视）江苏伍佳？他们做的是衬衫还是T恤？具体省了多少人力、面料节省率是多少？在周五演示前，你先把这些数据发我。数字对得上，我们再谈时间。",
      "actions": []
    },
